<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1722 0 R/Alt(Block diagram. A designer sends prompts to an LLM agent and reviews its work. The agent edits a chip project based on the AMS chip template and runs its make targets, which call the tools of the IIC-OSIC-TOOLS. The results flow back to the agent and the designer, the agent reads and writes a knowledge base, and all changes go through Git and GitHub.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 29076 0 R>>
