17952 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 17953 0 R/Alt(U-shaped flow diagram. Top row from left to right: RTL, elaborate, optimize. An arrow leads down from optimize to the bottom row, which runs from right to left: lower to gates, map to cells, and the netlist of standard cells. A Liberty box below map to cells feeds it. Grey labels on the arrows name examples of the cells in between: word-level add, mux, and dff after elaboration and optimization, generic AND, MUX, and DFF gates after lowering. Each tool box names its Yosys commands.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[27]/Pg 29215 0 R>>
endobj
