22392 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 22393 0 R/Alt(Block diagram split by a vertical dashed line into the write domain on the left, clocked by wclk, and the read domain on the right, clocked by rclk. A memory block straddles the line, with data_i entering from the left and data_o leaving to the right. Below it, the write pointer block (binary and Gray) on the left drives the write address of the memory, and the read pointer block on the right drives the read address. The Gray write pointer crosses the line into a synchronizer in the read domain, whose output enters an empty comparator together with the Gray read pointer. The Gray read pointer crosses into a synchronizer in the write domain, whose output enters a full comparator together with the Gray write pointer. push_i enters the write pointer, pop_i the read pointer, full_o and empty_o leave the comparators.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[13]/Pg 29276 0 R>>
endobj
