<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 23075 0 R/Alt(Timing diagram over six clock periods with four rows: clk_i, rst_ni, meta_q and rst_no. rst_ni falls in the middle of the second period, and meta_q and rst_no fall at the same moment. rst_ni rises just before the fifth rising edge. meta_q is unknown right after that edge and then high. rst_no rises at the sixth rising edge.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[11]/Pg 29283 0 R>>
endobj
